      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Forbes Property are delighted to present a unique opportunity to acquire this three-bedroom detached 1930's bungalow with attic conversion, positioned overlooking the sea. This property offers substantial refurbishment, extension, and development potential, Set on an impressive 0.225-acre plot, the property further benefits backing onto Warren Green with potential mews development (STPP). ________________________________________ Accommodation Overview • Porch: 1.80m x 2.00m, tiled floor, recess lights • Entrance Hall: 1.80m x 4.75m, stairs to attic, coving • Living Room: 4.00m x 4.80m, cast iron stove with surround, bay window, tv point, coving • Kitchen/Dining Room: 6.00m x 3.75m, fitted kitchen, oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated dishwasher, tiled floor, sliding door to lean-to • Lean-To Extension: 6.00m x 5.10m, rear extension with windows • Bedroom 1 (Front): 5.15m x 3.30m, fitted wardrobes, recess lights • Bedroom 2 (Rear): 3.35m x 3.30m, carpet flooring • Bedroom 3 (Front): 2.05m x 3.25m, fitted wardrobes • Bathroom: 2.15m x 2.25m, whb, wc, bath with electric shower, fully tiled • 1st Floor Attic: 6.90m x 2.25m, wood panelling, 2 x Velux windows, spotlights, whb House Approx.: 140 sqm / 1,500 sqft Attic Approx.: 28 sqm / 300 sqft Total Approx.: 168 sqm / 1,800 sqft ________________________________________ Plot & Gardens • Plot Dimensions: 50ft wide frontage x 200ft length (~0.225 acre) • Front Garden: Walled, lawn, large driveway with off-street parking for several cars, side vehicular entrance (~3m wide) • Rear Garden: South-facing, walled, paved patio • Shed: Large block-built shed to rear, corrugated steel roof (~15m x 7m) ________________________________________ Area & Local Amenities This wonderful seaside home is ideally situated in Baldoyle, only minutes' walk from Sutton Cross with transport links including DART and bus services, providing easy access to Dublin city centre. The property benefits from one of Dublin's most popular and convenient locations with an excellent choice of amenities: • Sutton Dinghy Club • Sutton Golf Club • Howth Yacht Club • Various football clubs • Excellent schools nearby Close proximity to the M50 and approximately a 15-minute drive to Dublin Airport makes this property ideal for both and families seeking a premium coastal location. ________________________________________ Highlights • 1930's detached bungalow with attic conversion • Sea views from living spaces • Large 0.225-acre plot Substantial refurbishment & extension potential • Rear access with mews development potential"
      },
